. *** 6. Shift-share (Bartik) instruments -----------------------------------------
. * Realised investment is not exogenous to the outcomes (better provinces attract
. * investment). The instrument predicts province investment from (a) the province's
. * sector composition of PMA / PMDN in a base window (first ss_window years) and (b) the
. * national growth of each of the 17 sectors relative to that window, computed leaving
. * the province itself out:
. *     pred_it = Ibar_i,base * sum_k s_ik * G_ikt,
. *     G_ikt   = sum_{j!=i} I_jkt / [ sum_{j!=i} sum_{base} I_jk / ss_window ]
. * Identification comes from differential exposure of provinces to sector-specific
. * national investment cycles (Goldsmith-Pinkham, Sorkin & Swift 2020: shares design;
. * Borusyak, Hull & Jaravel 2022: shocks design). The IV sample starts AFTER the share
. * window (ss_start), so the instrument is never mechanically equal to the regressor.
. * PMTB has no sector detail in the sheet, so the (PMA + PMDN) Bartik instruments ln PMTB
. * and ln(PMA + PMDN): for spec 1 the estimand is the PMTB effect identified from
. * BKPM-realisation shocks only (a LATE-type reading).
. global ss_start = $first_year + $ss_window

. preserve

. keep if inrange(Year, $first_year, $last_year)
(0 observations deleted)

. local secs A B C D E F G H I J K L MN O P Q RSTU

. local keep Code_Prov Year

. foreach s of local secs {
  2.         capture confirm variable `s'_PMA `s'_PMDN
  3.         if _rc {
  4.                 display as error "panel: sector columns `s'_PMA / `s'_PMDN not found"
  5.                 exit 111
  6.         }
  7.         rename `s'_PMA  PMA_`s'
  8.         rename `s'_PMDN PMDN_`s'
  9.         local keep `keep' PMA_`s' PMDN_`s'
 10. }

. keep `keep'

. reshape long PMA_ PMDN_, i(Code_Prov Year) j(sec) string
(j = A B C D E F G H I J K L MN O P Q RSTU)

Data                               Wide   ->   Long
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Number of observations              272   ->   4,624       
Number of variables                  36   ->   5           
j variable (17 values)                    ->   sec
xij variables:
               PMA_A PMA_B ... PMA_RSTU   ->   PMA_
            PMDN_A PMDN_B ... PMDN_RSTU   ->   PMDN_
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

. rename (PMA_ PMDN_) (vPMA vPMDN)

. local base0 = $first_year

. local base1 = $first_year + $ss_window - 1

. foreach v in PMA PMDN {
  2.         qui replace v`v' = 0 if missing(v`v') | v`v' < 0
  3.         bysort Code_Prov sec: egen double b_`v'  = total(cond(inrange(Year, `base0', `
> base1'), v`v', 0))   // province-sector base-window total
  4.         bysort Code_Prov:     egen double bi_`v' = total(cond(inrange(Year, `base0', `
> base1'), v`v', 0))   // province base-window total
  5.         gen double s_`v' = cond(bi_`v' > 0, b_`v' / bi_`v', 0)                        
>                        // base-window sector shares
  6.         bysort sec Year: egen double nat_`v' = total(v`v')                            
>                         // national sector total, year t
  7.         gen double loo_`v' = nat_`v' - v`v'                                           
>                         // leave-one-out
  8.         bysort sec: egen double natb_`v' = total(cond(inrange(Year, `base0', `base1'),
>  v`v', 0))
  9.         gen double loob_`v' = (natb_`v' - b_`v') / $ss_window                         
>                         // LOO base-window average per year
 10.         gen double G_`v' = cond(loob_`v' > 0, loo_`v' / loob_`v', 1)                  
>                        // LOO sector growth factor
 11.         gen double c_`v' = s_`v' * G_`v'
 12.         bysort Code_Prov Year: egen double bart_`v' = total(c_`v')                    
>                         // share-weighted growth
 13.         gen double pred_`v' = (bi_`v' / $ss_window) * bart_`v'                        
>                         // predicted level (Rp miliar)
 14.         gen double s2_`v' = s_`v'^2
 15.         bysort Code_Prov Year: egen double hhi_`v'  = total(s2_`v')                   
>                         // share concentration (HHI)
 16.         bysort Code_Prov Year: egen double npos_`v' = total(s_`v' > 0)                
>                         // sectors with a positive share
 17. }

. bysort Code_Prov Year: keep if _n == 1
(4,352 observations deleted)

. keep Code_Prov Year pred_PMA pred_PMDN bart_PMA bart_PMDN hhi_PMA hhi_PMDN npos_PMA npos_
> PMDN

. tempfile bartik

